---

## 🛡️ `.gitignore` (Main Directory)

```gitignore

# Authoringtool ignores
Authoringtool/.idea/
Authoringtool/target/
Authoringtool/*.log

# atl-auth-service ignores
atl-auth-service/node_modules/
atl-auth-service/dist/
atl-auth-service/.env

# Global ignores
*.DS_Store
*.log
.env


# Java
*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.ear

# Maven
target/
pom.xml.tag
pom.xml.releaseBackup
pom.xml.versionsBackup
release.properties

# Spring Boot
.env

# Logs
*.log
logs/
log/

# IDEs
.idea/
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.vscode/
*.swp

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Docker
*.env
*.pid
docker-compose.override.yml

# Node (if frontend is added later)
node_modules/
dist/
build/
.env.local
uploads/